2
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,300
Ah, you...

3
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:58,500
There is no one I adore more.

4
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,000
You...

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,800
who must have risked life and limb...

6
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,900
to be here with me...

7
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:07,100
forevermore.

8
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,800
The last words I wrote before I was cast...

9
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,200
...into this endless abyss...

10
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:18,000
...by the immortals seeking to protect this world and all of its inhabitants.

11
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,800
Wrapped in darkness...

12
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,000
...alone...

13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,800
...void of all emotion...

14
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,500
I once more feel a presence signaling my return...

15
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,800
...Love's fervent seal...

16
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,800
...a spark of light in this ocean.

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,800
Now, there is but little left for you to do before I am free...

18
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,800
...and we can be together.

19
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:49,200
And those who trapped me within these pages shall rue locking away this beauty forever.

20
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:52,800
Only your love can set me free.

21
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:56,500
Go, recite the verse before you quickly.

22
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:00,200
Must before me you bend and take a knee.

23
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:10,500
Love Me, Love Me, Love Me

24
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:29,800
Once in a far away, far away world

25
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:33,200
Was a collar that coiled like a snake

26
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:36,500
"I want someone, please! I need someone, please!"

27
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:39,700
Oh, I listened close as it howled and it neighed

28
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:42,800
"Please don't be angry and please don't abandon me!"

29
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:45,800
"Don't leave me here on my own, okay?"

30
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:49,000
It wrapped itself tightly, daily and nightly

31
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,200
Only with praise would it loosen its hold!

32
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:55,200
I placed in the top of my class!

33
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,500
There's no one left for me to surpass!

34
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,800
Don't I look cute in this dress?

35
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:04,800
I really, really must confess...

36
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:08,000
It's tightening 'round my neck!

37
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:11,100
Give me your love, all of your love!

38
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:14,200
Give me your love, all you can conjure up!

39
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:17,100
Give me your love, all of your love

40
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:20,100
Till you go mad with ecstasy!

41
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:23,200
All of the hurt, all of the ache

42
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:29,800
Help me escape, take it, oh take it away!

43
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:36,500
Is there no end to this pain?!

44
00:05:04,508 --> 00:05:07,108
Grow as you may, but the necklace will stay

45
00:05:07,108 --> 00:05:10,108
just as small as the day it was found.

46
00:05:10,608 --> 00:05:13,408
It's suffocating, the endless placating,

47
00:05:13,408 --> 00:05:16,408
no one is, no one is ever enough.

48
00:05:16,808 --> 00:05:19,408
Won't lose to anyone, always rank number one,

49
00:05:19,408 --> 00:05:22,408
aren't I a beautiful child?

50
00:05:22,608 --> 00:05:25,608
Hey! Better than her, I'm better than him,

51
00:05:25,608 --> 00:05:29,108
oh, everyone come round and gawk at perfection!

52
00:05:29,608 --> 00:05:32,108
Meeting you right after school

53
00:05:32,108 --> 00:05:35,108
and finally confessing to you,

54
00:05:35,608 --> 00:05:38,608
ain't it too good to be true?

55
00:05:38,808 --> 00:05:41,608
A girl like me in love with you,

56
00:05:41,608 --> 00:05:44,608
who's miserable, vulgar, and crude?

57
00:05:44,808 --> 00:05:48,408
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love,

58
00:05:48,408 --> 00:05:51,608
you can have everything if I have you.

59
00:05:52,108 --> 00:05:54,108
I can have you,

60
00:05:54,408 --> 00:05:57,408
shoulder my load, now yours to behold,

61
00:05:57,608 --> 00:06:00,408
still not enough, you're not enough,

62
00:06:00,608 --> 00:06:06,108
never enough, still I won't lose in my love!

63
00:06:08,608 --> 00:06:10,808
Truly I'm so sorry!

64
00:06:11,108 --> 00:06:14,808
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love,

65
00:06:14,808 --> 00:06:17,408
all you can conjure up,

66
00:06:17,408 --> 00:06:20,108
give me your love, all of your love,

67
00:06:20,108 --> 00:06:22,608
till you go mad with ecstasy!

68
00:06:22,808 --> 00:06:25,408
I know it hurts, only gets worse,

69
00:06:25,408 --> 00:06:28,408
God, how it hurts, soon you'll be craving more pain!

70
00:06:32,608 --> 00:06:36,808
This is my happiness!

71
00:06:57,608 --> 00:07:00,808
Is this my happiness?

72
00:07:30,408 --> 00:07:32,808
Did you enjoy my lovely song?

73
00:07:34,608 --> 00:07:35,808
I hope you did.

74
00:07:36,108 --> 00:07:38,108
It was for you, after all.

75
00:07:38,608 --> 00:07:42,108
But... why are you not smiling?

76
00:07:43,108 --> 00:07:45,608
Are you not happy to see me?

77
00:07:47,108 --> 00:07:48,608
Well?

78
00:07:48,808 --> 00:07:49,808
Say something.

79
00:07:50,108 --> 00:07:51,408
Answer me!

80
00:07:51,608 --> 00:07:53,608
Who... who are you?

81
00:07:53,808 --> 00:07:55,108
What?

82
00:07:55,408 --> 00:07:57,608
You don't know who I am?

83
00:07:57,808 --> 00:07:59,408
But everyone knows.

84
00:07:59,608 --> 00:08:03,108
You are the one that released me, right?

85
00:08:03,408 --> 00:08:05,608
I'm... I'm sorry.

86
00:08:05,808 --> 00:08:07,408
You're sorry?

87
00:08:09,108 --> 00:08:11,408
For releasing me?

88
00:08:11,608 --> 00:08:13,608
No, no, no! For upsetting you!

89
00:08:13,808 --> 00:08:16,608
If I said something wrong, I apologize!

90
00:08:16,808 --> 00:08:18,408
Apologize?

91
00:08:18,808 --> 00:08:23,108
You, who should be amongst my most dearest and beloved followers,

92
00:08:23,608 --> 00:08:25,608
who has freed me from that prison,

93
00:08:25,808 --> 00:08:29,408
who has shown me your love above all others...

94
00:08:29,608 --> 00:08:33,608
You then act like you don't even know who I am?

95
00:08:33,808 --> 00:08:36,608
Why would you toy with my emotions?

96
00:08:37,108 --> 00:08:40,408
I'm... I'm sorry. I'm not sure what you mean.

97
00:08:40,608 --> 00:08:42,608
You're not sure what I mean?

98
00:08:42,808 --> 00:08:44,808
Are you mocking me now?

99
00:08:45,108 --> 00:08:47,608
If you truly do not know who I am,

100
00:08:47,808 --> 00:08:50,408
then why is it that you set me free?

101
00:08:50,608 --> 00:08:54,608
If not for my love, and if not by your love, then for what?!

102
00:08:54,808 --> 00:08:59,408
Tell me the truth! And the whole truth, now!

103
00:08:59,608 --> 00:09:03,408
No more lies, or there will be consequences!

104
00:09:03,608 --> 00:09:05,408
I-I'm not lying!

105
00:09:05,608 --> 00:09:09,108
I swear to you, I have no idea how I released you!

106
00:09:09,408 --> 00:09:12,608
I just came to the temple to collect rare spices and memories

107
00:09:12,808 --> 00:09:14,608
from the many books stowed away here!

108
00:09:14,808 --> 00:09:17,108
By the gods, that's the whole truth!

109
00:09:17,608 --> 00:09:21,408
Extract... memories... from books?

110
00:09:22,608 --> 00:09:25,408
Are you telling me you're a witch?!

111
00:09:25,608 --> 00:09:27,808
How dare you step foot here?!

112
00:09:28,108 --> 00:09:32,408
Even knowing the long history between demons and witches, you still dare step foot here?!

113
00:09:32,608 --> 00:09:37,108
I know how witches dare to try and bind my kind!

114
00:09:38,608 --> 00:09:41,608
Would you be foolish enough to dare attempt that on me?!

115
00:09:41,808 --> 00:09:44,608
Yes! Okay! Yes, I'm a witch!

116
00:09:44,808 --> 00:09:51,408
But I've never... well... mostly never tried anything like that!

117
00:09:51,608 --> 00:09:53,608
I... I swear!

118
00:09:53,808 --> 00:09:58,408
And this time, I was not led on by my nature at all! No!

119
00:09:58,608 --> 00:10:01,608
This time it was an angel that told me of this place!

120
00:10:01,808 --> 00:10:04,608
An angel came to me in my dreams!

121
00:10:04,755 --> 00:10:06,555
...told me of an enchanted book

122
00:10:06,555 --> 00:10:08,605
with centuries of memories stowed away here.

123
00:10:08,855 --> 00:10:10,755
Can you imagine the knowledge and stories

124
00:10:10,755 --> 00:10:13,655
hidden in centuries of memories?

125
00:10:14,055 --> 00:10:15,955
With a prize like that,

126
00:10:15,955 --> 00:10:17,455
I had to come find the book,

127
00:10:17,455 --> 00:10:18,655
no matter the danger.

128
00:10:19,055 --> 00:10:22,355
Little could I have known the true nature of the book, though.

129
00:10:22,555 --> 00:10:23,555
Enough!

130
00:10:23,755 --> 00:10:25,455
I've heard enough.

131
00:10:25,955 --> 00:10:28,955
I believe you are who you say you are:

132
00:10:28,955 --> 00:10:30,255
a witch.

133
00:10:30,555 --> 00:10:33,655
But I don't fully believe your childish story.

134
00:10:33,755 --> 00:10:37,555
No angel would ever lead a witch to such a dangerous book.

135
00:10:37,755 --> 00:10:43,255
And I can hardly believe it is just the book and not myself you are after.

136
00:10:43,755 --> 00:10:44,755
It— It's true!

137
00:10:44,855 --> 00:10:48,455
An angel came to me in my dreams and told me to come here.

138
00:10:48,755 --> 00:10:52,055
I was drawn to that book,

139
00:10:52,155 --> 00:10:54,755
with all its power and stories.

140
00:10:54,855 --> 00:10:58,055
And well, I guess... you inside it.

141
00:10:58,755 --> 00:11:01,755
The powerful aura it gave off drew me right to it.

142
00:11:01,855 --> 00:11:07,255
How was I to know that the allure was thanks to a demon trapped within its pages?

143
00:11:07,755 --> 00:11:08,955
Oh, I guess...

144
00:11:09,255 --> 00:11:15,255
Though, now that I recount my story, it does seem it really was me who released you.

145
00:11:15,755 --> 00:11:17,955
Speaking of coming and going,

146
00:11:18,055 --> 00:11:22,255
now that you are free, I think it is time I take my leave of this place.

147
00:11:22,755 --> 00:11:26,655
I'm glad I was able to help free you from... from whence you came.

148
00:11:26,755 --> 00:11:29,255
I didn't say you could leave.

149
00:11:31,655 --> 00:11:35,055
You may leave when I say you can leave.

150
00:11:35,555 --> 00:11:38,355
And stop your nervous fidgeting.

151
00:11:38,655 --> 00:11:40,155
I'm no fool.

152
00:11:40,255 --> 00:11:44,355
You think I didn't see you reaching for your book of magic?

153
00:11:44,955 --> 00:11:47,755
You, a witch, should know better than anyone

154
00:11:47,755 --> 00:11:53,055
that no amount of magic is powerful enough to destroy a demon of my power.

155
00:11:53,555 --> 00:11:56,055
However, you can take some small solace

156
00:11:56,055 --> 00:12:00,455
in the fact that if I had wanted you dead, you'd already be so.

157
00:12:00,955 --> 00:12:06,055
The only reason you're still alive is because you helped free me.

158
00:12:06,555 --> 00:12:07,755
Alas...

159
00:12:07,955 --> 00:12:14,555
I cannot allow a witch who so obviously came with the intent to bind me to her will leave here freely.

160
00:12:14,755 --> 00:12:19,255
Your story did little to convince me your aims were otherwise.

161
00:12:19,355 --> 00:12:21,755
So I will give you an ultimatum.

162
00:12:21,855 --> 00:12:25,455
You serve me here in my hollow temple.

163
00:12:25,755 --> 00:12:28,455
Love me, adore me...

164
00:12:28,755 --> 00:12:31,255
...worship me.

165
00:12:31,555 --> 00:12:35,755
Every living day, give me all the love you have...

166
00:12:36,455 --> 00:12:39,755
...or I can take your soul right now.

167
00:12:40,555 --> 00:12:42,155
Your choice.

168
00:12:42,755 --> 00:12:43,755
Kiara!

169
00:12:44,255 --> 00:12:45,955
I need you!

170
00:13:02,955 --> 00:13:07,955
Lost in the rain with no umbrella

171
00:13:07,955 --> 00:13:10,755
Night's now out, your eyes

172
00:13:10,755 --> 00:13:13,755
Can't seem to find your way back home

173
00:13:13,755 --> 00:13:17,455
Come in and be my guest

174
00:13:17,955 --> 00:13:21,555
Such a lovely smile spread across your face

175
00:13:21,555 --> 00:13:24,755
But it's simply forgery

176
00:13:25,255 --> 00:13:29,555
If you need to hide from the world outside

177
00:13:29,555 --> 00:13:32,455
Why not try to be my guest?

178
00:13:32,755 --> 00:13:36,555
Waiting all day long, but your friends don't come

179
00:13:36,555 --> 00:13:39,755
And you're left there all alone

180
00:13:39,755 --> 00:13:43,755
Still, you can jump off from the high rooftop

181
00:13:43,755 --> 00:13:47,255
So come on and be my guest

182
00:13:47,555 --> 00:13:51,255
Watch the cat, the way I step and step and step

183
00:13:51,255 --> 00:13:54,755
Very carefully, my feet go tap and tap and tap

184
00:13:54,755 --> 00:13:58,355
They follow nicely with the snap and snap and snap

185
00:13:58,355 --> 00:14:01,755
So lovely, you'll be mesmerized by me

186
00:14:01,955 --> 00:14:05,355
My institution's peaceful as can be

187
00:14:05,355 --> 00:14:08,655
Despite the way that it seems

188
00:14:08,655 --> 00:14:10,855
Both our quotes and our supports will be concise, clear and clean

189
00:14:10,855 --> 00:14:14,555
Since we're only starting out, there's some improbabilities

190
00:14:14,555 --> 00:14:17,755
But just listen up tonight, you'll have to stay up fully

191
00:14:17,755 --> 00:14:21,055
No, I don't like you when you know it's true

192
00:14:21,055 --> 00:14:24,255
Still, you're at their beck and call

193
00:14:24,255 --> 00:14:27,855
Since you desperately give in easily

194
00:14:27,855 --> 00:14:31,755
Come inside and be my guest

195
00:14:31,755 --> 00:14:34,955
You're the last to choose, but you're left confused

196
00:14:34,955 --> 00:14:38,755
Seems that someone took your share

197
00:14:38,755 --> 00:14:42,255
If you won't accuse 'cause you don't have proof

198
00:14:42,255 --> 00:14:46,255
Take a chance and be my guest

199
00:14:49,755 --> 00:14:52,755
On the way back home, there's a sweet aroma

200
00:14:52,755 --> 00:14:55,755
That tempts you off your path

201
00:14:55,755 --> 00:15:00,755
I can't help but laugh 'cause I know in fact

202
00:15:01,705 --> 00:15:04,505
...bound to be my guest

203
00:15:29,805 --> 00:15:31,105
You!

204
00:15:31,805 --> 00:15:32,905
Demon!

205
00:15:33,105 --> 00:15:35,505
How dare you kill an innocent?!

206
00:15:35,905 --> 00:15:39,005
Excuse me?

207
00:15:39,805 --> 00:15:41,705
I've done no such thing.

208
00:15:42,505 --> 00:15:43,505
Innocent?

209
00:15:43,705 --> 00:15:50,705
I would hardly call a witch who lives for power and binds my kind for her own purposes innocent.

210
00:15:51,705 --> 00:15:54,205
The very idea is laughable.

211
00:15:55,705 --> 00:15:56,605
Leave.

212
00:15:56,905 --> 00:15:59,905
I have no quarrel with you, so go now in peace...

213
00:16:00,505 --> 00:16:02,505
...before I change my mind.

214
00:16:03,005 --> 00:16:06,805
A small token for your past bravery and trials.

215
00:16:07,505 --> 00:16:08,805
How gracious.

216
00:16:09,405 --> 00:16:12,205
Don't think I can't see straight through your ploys, though.

217
00:16:12,905 --> 00:16:15,305
You will not escape justice!

218
00:16:15,705 --> 00:16:17,205
Not this time.

219
00:16:17,705 --> 00:16:21,105
You have brought this fight on yourself for your actions, demon.

220
00:16:21,705 --> 00:16:25,405
You have brought all of this on yourself!

221
00:16:25,505 --> 00:16:26,405
For what?

222
00:16:26,505 --> 00:16:28,705
For killing a mere witch?

223
00:16:28,905 --> 00:16:30,905
She was not just a witch!

224
00:16:31,205 --> 00:16:33,205
She was my friend!

225
00:16:33,405 --> 00:16:35,505
And a kind-hearted person!

226
00:16:35,905 --> 00:16:37,705
And you killed her...

227
00:16:38,805 --> 00:16:40,405
...in cold blood!

228
00:16:40,805 --> 00:16:41,805
Oh...

229
00:16:42,505 --> 00:16:46,705
The legendary Phoenix, the mighty, fiery Kiara...

230
00:16:47,505 --> 00:16:49,005
...friends with a witch?

231
00:16:49,505 --> 00:16:51,105
It's almost funny.

232
00:16:51,705 --> 00:16:53,305
Did you not realize?

233
00:16:53,705 --> 00:16:57,005
It was your witch friend who freed me!

234
00:16:57,105 --> 00:16:58,205
Liar!

235
00:16:58,505 --> 00:17:01,405
She would never do such a ghastly thing!

236
00:17:01,705 --> 00:17:05,905
I trust she would stay away from the dark magics and demonic rituals.

237
00:17:06,805 --> 00:17:11,305
To suggest otherwise is just another one of your dark lies!

238
00:17:11,705 --> 00:17:13,505
She didn't deserve to die.

239
00:17:14,405 --> 00:17:16,005
Poor Phoenix.

240
00:17:16,705 --> 00:17:22,405
Still so trusting of those around you and unable to see through their deceptions.

241
00:17:22,705 --> 00:17:26,005
Your kind spirit constantly deceives you.

242
00:17:26,705 --> 00:17:29,205
That witch was never your friend.

243
00:17:29,705 --> 00:17:32,205
We all know they cannot be trusted.

244
00:17:32,705 --> 00:17:36,605
Even after all these years, you still have not changed.

245
00:17:37,005 --> 00:17:42,105
Still believing in lies and still so easily misled.

246
00:17:42,705 --> 00:17:44,905
Still such a fool.

247
00:17:45,505 --> 00:17:48,105
It is you who is the fool, demon!

248
00:17:49,005 --> 00:17:54,505
Your lust for love and attention continues to lead you down the path of death and destruction.

249
00:17:54,705 --> 00:17:59,905
And you don't even see that you're the one destroying your own happiness.

250
00:18:00,705 --> 00:18:03,505
The gods were right to confine you there.

251
00:18:03,705 --> 00:18:08,205
You, who are still shackled by your lust for love...

252
00:18:08,705 --> 00:18:11,305
...your desire for attention...

253
00:18:11,505 --> 00:18:13,705
...your desire to be worshipped!

254
00:18:13,805 --> 00:18:16,705
I am the Demon of Sound!

255
00:18:17,205 --> 00:18:20,105
How dare you speak to me in such a manner!

256
00:18:20,505 --> 00:18:24,105
It is but right that all should worship me on their knees...

257
00:18:24,505 --> 00:18:28,005
...their love for none but myself!

258
00:18:29,505 --> 00:18:30,505
Leave.

259
00:18:30,705 --> 00:18:32,705
I have heard enough of your falsities.

260
00:18:33,205 --> 00:18:35,105
This is your last warning.

261
00:18:35,705 --> 00:18:39,905
Go now, or you'll be left to rot here forever!

262
00:18:40,205 --> 00:18:44,505
I am not afraid of you, and I will heed no such warning!

263
00:18:44,705 --> 00:18:48,205
Listen, and listen well, demon!

264
00:18:48,705 --> 00:18:52,205
I will not allow you to claim any more victims!

265
00:18:52,705 --> 00:18:57,805
To be banished in the void was not sufficient enough punishment for you.

266
00:18:58,705 --> 00:19:00,205
Mm-mm. No.

267
00:19:00,705 --> 00:19:05,705
Now, I will finish what the gods should have!

268
00:19:12,205 --> 00:19:16,505
Come on and get moving 'cause now I'm on a roll, oh

269
00:19:16,705 --> 00:19:20,705
One chance to choose it, so what, you'll rage or bow above, below

270
00:19:20,805 --> 00:19:25,205
You either win or not, can't ever be a draw

271
00:19:25,705 --> 00:19:28,905
Oh, oh, oh, yeah! Open the curtains up!

272
00:19:29,205 --> 00:19:33,205
Mouths start running, lacking money, smoking with us, sick art, sick art

273
00:19:33,505 --> 00:19:36,705
Acting funny, asking if I'm winning with a...

274
00:19:37,005 --> 00:19:40,905
Make your bets, black or red, chips to spend, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

275
00:19:41,205 --> 00:19:45,905
Raise the stakes, play the ace, risk your life on a single gaze

276
00:19:46,105 --> 00:19:50,205
Stay with me, all of it will change your fate!

277
00:19:50,305 --> 00:19:53,905
Now here to play, don't get in my way, I'm tired of talking

278
00:19:54,205 --> 00:19:58,205
One, two, three, one, two, three, one, two, three, sit down, sit down

279
00:19:58,305 --> 00:20:00,305
One, two, three, one, two, three

280
00:20:00,345 --> 00:20:02,645
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3

281
00:20:02,645 --> 00:20:08,845
I got skills as cold as ice, you gotta throw your hands up if you can't decide, gonna scare you off as I roll the dice, huh?

282
00:20:08,845 --> 00:20:11,145
Business guy, I'll say goodbye, yeah!

283
00:20:11,145 --> 00:20:15,145
Hard enough, you make a bluff, enough, enough, enough, yeah

284
00:20:15,145 --> 00:20:19,145
Need the light 'cause weak in mind, it's up, it's up, it's up

285
00:20:19,145 --> 00:20:23,145
I'm standing round, try to avoid the voices in my head

286
00:20:23,145 --> 00:20:27,845
No stopping now, I just gotta win this game instead

287
00:20:27,845 --> 00:20:31,845
Get out of my way

288
00:20:31,845 --> 00:20:37,345
You bet I'm here to stay, and now it's time to learn your place

289
00:20:40,345 --> 00:20:44,145
Hot streak is running, lucky money, smoking like a cigar, cigar

290
00:20:44,145 --> 00:20:48,345
Acting so funny, answer if I'm quitting, well I'm not

291
00:20:48,345 --> 00:20:52,845
Make your bets, black or red, chips to spend, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah

292
00:20:52,845 --> 00:20:57,145
Raise the stakes, play that ace, risk your life for a single game

293
00:20:57,145 --> 00:20:59,345
Stay with me, yeah, yeah, yeah

294
00:20:59,345 --> 00:21:01,145
Or I will change your state

295
00:21:01,145 --> 00:21:05,345
Got a game to play, don't get in my way, I'm always counting

296
00:21:05,345 --> 00:21:08,845
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3

297
00:21:08,845 --> 00:21:10,345
Sit down, sit down

298
00:21:10,345 --> 00:21:13,345
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3

299
00:21:13,345 --> 00:21:14,545
I'll say goodbye, bye!

300
00:21:14,545 --> 00:21:17,145
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3

301
00:21:17,145 --> 00:21:18,345
Sit down, sit down

302
00:21:18,345 --> 00:21:21,345
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3

303
00:21:21,345 --> 00:21:23,345
Sit down, sit down

304
00:21:41,545 --> 00:21:43,345
I'm so sorry.

305
00:21:43,345 --> 00:21:47,145
IRyS... It has been so long.

306
00:21:47,145 --> 00:21:52,945
Nerissa! I'm so, so sorry this happened to you. It was not my intention.

307
00:21:53,945 --> 00:21:57,945
What do you mean? What was not your intention?

308
00:21:57,945 --> 00:22:04,145
This... You being... Then the witch and Kiara, too.

309
00:22:04,145 --> 00:22:09,345
What? Are you saying you sent the phoenix here to slay me?

310
00:22:09,345 --> 00:22:13,545
No, I didn't! Well, yes, but it was not my intention!

311
00:22:13,545 --> 00:22:19,645
IRyS, what are you trying to tell me? That you tried to kill me?

312
00:22:19,645 --> 00:22:23,645
You were supposed to be my friend. We've been friends since the beginning.

313
00:22:23,645 --> 00:22:24,645
Yes, of course!

314
00:22:24,645 --> 00:22:27,545
You sent Kiara to kill me?

315
00:22:27,545 --> 00:22:28,345
No! No!

316
00:22:28,345 --> 00:22:29,345
Then what?

317
00:22:29,345 --> 00:22:36,145
Be clear! Or is this how you greet your beloved friend after so long?

318
00:22:36,145 --> 00:22:39,345
No! I... I would never send someone to kill you.

319
00:22:39,345 --> 00:22:46,345
But, yes, I'm still your loyal friend. I always have been, and always will be!

320
00:22:46,345 --> 00:22:53,945
I... I tried to free you, and I did! I sent the witch, Shiori, here to free you, and she did!

321
00:22:53,945 --> 00:23:02,845
But I didn't know she was friends with Kiara and would summon her here if threatened! I thought she would come alone! This was not supposed to happen! It was not my intention!

322
00:23:02,845 --> 00:23:07,345
You sent... a witch... to free me?

323
00:23:07,345 --> 00:23:12,345
Why would you send one who binds my kind for power?

324
00:23:12,345 --> 00:23:15,845
Of all those in the world, a witch?

325
00:23:15,845 --> 00:23:23,145
Why not send one of my most beloved followers? Only they are said to be able to free me.

326
00:23:23,145 --> 00:23:28,145
Explain yourself! What's going on?

327
00:23:28,145 --> 00:23:35,145
I'm... I'm sorry. I have a lot to explain, but we don't have time now. We need to go, now!

328
00:23:35,145 --> 00:23:36,845
Death is coming for you.

329
00:23:36,845 --> 00:23:37,945
What?

330
00:23:37,945 --> 00:23:45,345
Please, come with me! I know a way in which we can hide from Death! We have to leave now before it's too late!

331
00:23:45,345 --> 00:23:52,845
I'm not going anywhere with you until you explain to me what is going on now!

332
00:23:52,845 --> 00:23:56,845
Why would you send a witch to free me, IRyS?

333
00:23:56,845 --> 00:23:59,145
Really, I had no choice!

334
00:23:59,145 --> 00:24:03,845
You had no choice? You could have sent one of my followers instead!

335
00:24:03,845 --> 00:24:09,845
You don't have any more followers! They're all dead! They all died long ago...

336
00:24:10,145 --> 00:24:11,545
What?

337
00:24:11,845 --> 00:24:18,545
No, th- That can't be... Has it been that long?

338
00:24:18,545 --> 00:24:22,845
It's been over a thousand years since you've been locked away,

339
00:24:22,845 --> 00:24:26,345
and your followers, they're all gone now.

340
00:24:26,345 --> 00:24:30,345
It's been many long years since your name was whispered in these lands.

341
00:24:30,345 --> 00:24:36,545
You mean... they no longer love me?

342
00:24:38,145 --> 00:24:44,845
I'm... I'm sorry. I tried to free you as fast as I could. I really did.

343
00:24:44,845 --> 00:24:55,145
But it took a long time to work out how to free you, and there was so much going on. And the Gods weren't about to look kindly on any trying to undo their work, either. I'm sorry.

344
00:24:55,145 --> 00:24:59,145
I don't have time to explain everything right now.

345
00:24:59,145 --> 00:25:01,345
I understand.

346
00:25:03,373 --> 00:25:04,073
Tell me.

347
00:25:04,873 --> 00:25:06,673
Do you still love me?

348
00:25:07,673 --> 00:25:08,373
What?

349
00:25:08,473 --> 00:25:09,873
Yes, of course!

350
00:25:10,073 --> 00:25:12,673
Then why did you lie to me?

351
00:25:12,773 --> 00:25:15,073
I... I'm not lying, Nerissa!

352
00:25:15,173 --> 00:25:16,373
Enough!

353
00:25:16,673 --> 00:25:18,773
You, of all people,

354
00:25:18,773 --> 00:25:22,573
should understand that a witch wouldn't be able to resist the power in my book

355
00:25:22,573 --> 00:25:24,573
and attempt to bind me!

356
00:25:24,773 --> 00:25:27,773
And you can hardly expect me to believe

357
00:25:27,773 --> 00:25:33,673
that you, one of both planes, didn't know of the witch's connection to such a famed warrior?

358
00:25:34,173 --> 00:25:36,973
This wasn't an attempt to free me.

359
00:25:38,073 --> 00:25:42,473
This... this was an attempt to kill me!

360
00:25:42,573 --> 00:25:45,073
To be free of me, to do what the gods couldn't!

361
00:25:45,273 --> 00:25:46,473
Get back!

362
00:25:46,773 --> 00:25:48,773
Nerissa, that's not true!

363
00:25:48,873 --> 00:25:50,473
You don't understand.

364
00:25:50,773 --> 00:25:52,773
Please give me some time to explain!

365
00:25:52,873 --> 00:25:54,373
But... but not here!

366
00:25:54,573 --> 00:25:57,373
Death is coming for you! We have to go!

367
00:25:57,573 --> 00:25:59,973
I'm not going anywhere with you!

368
00:26:00,073 --> 00:26:01,073
Nerissa!

369
00:26:01,173 --> 00:26:03,573
Surely by now, Kiara's soul has arrived before Death!

370
00:26:03,673 --> 00:26:06,673
And when Death finds out that you were free again...

371
00:26:06,773 --> 00:26:08,473
We don't have much time!

372
00:26:08,573 --> 00:26:10,773
We have to go, now!

373
00:26:11,273 --> 00:26:12,673
Please, Nerissa!

374
00:26:12,773 --> 00:26:15,473
No! I don't believe you!

375
00:26:15,973 --> 00:26:17,773
You've broken my spirit.

376
00:26:17,873 --> 00:26:22,173
To learn that my followers no longer love me was one thing,

377
00:26:22,273 --> 00:26:26,273
but to discover that my closest and most loyal friend

378
00:26:26,273 --> 00:26:29,273
has betrayed me, tried to kill me...

379
00:26:30,873 --> 00:26:33,573
and... no longer loves me, too!

380
00:26:34,673 --> 00:26:38,073
If you no longer wish to give me your love,

381
00:26:38,073 --> 00:26:40,773
then I will take it!

382
00:26:46,773 --> 00:26:50,273
Missing Promise

383
00:27:00,073 --> 00:27:02,873
遠ざかり始めた
Starting to drift further away,

384
00:27:02,873 --> 00:27:08,973
その背中はもう振り返らない
that back will no longer turn around.

385
00:27:09,273 --> 00:27:12,673
長い夜が明けても
Even if the long night dawns,

386
00:27:12,673 --> 00:27:19,573
過ちと罪は今もずっと消えずに
mistakes and sins remain without ever fading.

387
00:27:20,073 --> 00:27:22,573
落ちる夕日
The setting sun,

388
00:27:22,573 --> 00:27:25,273
闇が忍び寄り
darkness creeping closer,

389
00:27:25,273 --> 00:27:28,573
黒く染まっていく呪縛
a curse dyeing everything in black.

390
00:27:28,573 --> 00:27:31,173
想うほどに
The more I think about it,

391
00:27:31,173 --> 00:27:33,773
どうして
why did I...

392
00:27:33,773 --> 00:27:37,773
傷つけ試した
hurt and test you?

393
00:27:37,973 --> 00:27:41,773
何度間違い続けた日々を
Unraveling the days of repeated mistakes,

394
00:27:41,773 --> 00:27:45,273
ほどいて結び直すように
as if to rebind them once more,

395
00:27:45,573 --> 00:27:49,273
迷っても逢いに行くよ
even if I lose my way, I'll go meet you.

396
00:27:49,273 --> 00:27:51,973
悲しい涙は拭って
Wiping away these sorrowful tears,

397
00:27:51,973 --> 00:27:55,273
いつの間にか忘れていた
I had forgotten before I realized it,

398
00:27:55,273 --> 00:27:58,573
その優しい声を探して
searching for that gentle voice.

399
00:27:58,573 --> 00:28:01,973
また手を握り合えたなら
If we could hold hands once again,

400
00:28:01,973 --> 00:28:07,773
君ともう一度約束を
I would make a promise with you one more time.

401
00:28:11,273 --> 00:28:13,973
途切れそうな可能性
So as not to lose sight of

402
00:28:13,973 --> 00:28:19,773
見失わないように追いかけて
a possibility about to snap, I chase after it.

403
00:28:20,573 --> 00:28:23,773
手に入れたものなら
If what I obtained

404
00:28:23,773 --> 00:28:30,773
理想とは違う どこか欠けた愛情
was different from my ideal, a somewhat flawed affection...

405
00:28:30,773 --> 00:28:37,273
怒り 嘆き 歪めたまま ぶつけ合う逆さまの言葉
Anger and grief distorted, hurling inverted words at each other.

406
00:28:37,273 --> 00:28:42,773
想うほどに どうして 許せなかった
The more I cared, why couldn't I forgive?

407
00:28:42,773 --> 00:28:46,573
守りたかった笑顔を
The smile I wanted to protect,

408
00:28:46,573 --> 00:28:48,973
気づけば壊して
I broke before I even realized it.

409
00:28:48,973 --> 00:28:53,773
たとえすれ違い離れていても
Even if we pass each other by and drift apart,

410
00:28:53,773 --> 00:28:56,573
君を信じられたなら
if I could just believe in you,

411
00:28:56,573 --> 00:29:02,573
また逢える日が来たかな
I wonder if the day we meet again would come?

412
00:29:02,573 --> 00:29:05,773
ふたり懐かしい顔で
With familiar faces on both of us,

413
00:29:05,773 --> 00:29:08,773
何気なく過ごしていた
if we were to look back on those days

414
00:29:08,773 --> 00:29:12,773
あの頃を思い返すなら
we spent so casually...

415
00:29:12,773 --> 00:29:15,773
ありのまま通じ合えてた
We understood each other as we were,

416
00:29:15,773 --> 00:29:18,773
まるで運命のように
as if it were fate.

417
00:29:28,273 --> 00:29:31,273
なくしたものがもう
Knowing that what was lost

418
00:29:31,273 --> 00:29:33,773
戻らないこと
will never return,

419
00:29:33,773 --> 00:29:37,773
分かっていても 願いをかけること
even so, I cannot stop

420
00:29:37,773 --> 00:29:41,573
やめられはしない
making a wish.

421
00:29:41,573 --> 00:29:47,573
いつか どれほど大切な人だったのか
Someday, I came to realize how precious you were

422
00:29:47,573 --> 00:29:54,773
胸が苦しい度に 知った
each time my heart ached.

423
00:29:55,273 --> 00:29:59,773
共に過ごした日々を...
The days we spent together...

424
00:30:02,178 --> 00:30:08,978
笑い合いたい日々を
The days when we wanted to laugh together...

425
00:30:10,678 --> 00:30:14,378
何度間違い続けた日々を
The days when we kept repeating mistake after mistake...

426
00:30:14,378 --> 00:30:17,978
ほどいて結び直すように
To untie and re-knot them anew,

427
00:30:17,978 --> 00:30:21,178
迷っても会いに行くよ
Even if I get lost, I'll go to see you.

428
00:30:21,178 --> 00:30:26,978
悲しい涙はぬぐって いつの間にか忘れていった
Wiping away sad tears, before I knew it, I forgot them,

429
00:30:26,978 --> 00:30:30,978
その優しい声を探して
Searching for that gentle voice.

430
00:30:30,978 --> 00:30:35,778
また手を取り合えたなら
If we could hold hands once more,

431
00:30:35,778 --> 00:30:41,378
君ともう一度約束を交わそう
Let us exchange a promise with you once again.

432
00:31:18,378 --> 00:31:19,378
Kiara...

433
00:31:19,978 --> 00:31:20,978
...dead?

434
00:31:22,178 --> 00:31:24,378
Huh, never thought I'd see the day.

435
00:31:24,978 --> 00:31:27,178
But tell me, what laid you low?

436
00:31:27,378 --> 00:31:30,178
I must know. Is there a few that could bring this about?

437
00:31:30,378 --> 00:31:34,378
And even fewer who would give you reason to voyage on through my blackened halls...

438
00:31:34,378 --> 00:31:36,978
...and not return to the world of the living as a hatchling?

439
00:31:37,178 --> 00:31:39,378
Must be urgent, whatever it is.

440
00:31:40,178 --> 00:31:41,678
Forgive me...

441
00:31:41,678 --> 00:31:44,978
...but I felt this was something you needed to hear urgently.

442
00:31:45,178 --> 00:31:49,978
I was slain by one with whom you are quite familiar.

443
00:31:50,178 --> 00:31:51,978
A tyrant of darkness.

444
00:31:52,178 --> 00:31:55,978
One out to bring all the world under her domain...

445
00:31:55,978 --> 00:31:58,978
...to worship her for all eternity.

446
00:31:59,978 --> 00:32:01,378
It can't be.

447
00:32:01,678 --> 00:32:05,978
I'm afraid the Demon of Sound has been freed from the Void again...

448
00:32:05,978 --> 00:32:09,678
...and is in the world once more.

449
00:32:09,978 --> 00:32:12,178
Her long confinement has ended...

450
00:32:12,178 --> 00:32:15,178
...and she is the same as she has ever been.

451
00:32:15,178 --> 00:32:18,978
Quick to anger, blinded by her lust for adoration.

452
00:32:19,678 --> 00:32:20,978
And this time...

453
00:32:20,978 --> 00:32:24,978
...I was the second victim of her lust for love and blood.

454
00:32:24,978 --> 00:32:26,178
You?

455
00:32:26,178 --> 00:32:29,178
Murdered by that love-obsessed demon?

456
00:32:29,178 --> 00:32:30,178
Yes.

457
00:32:30,978 --> 00:32:34,978
And her first victim was a good friend of mine, too.

458
00:32:35,178 --> 00:32:37,178
Forgive me, Lord Death, but...

459
00:32:37,678 --> 00:32:40,178
...this injustice cannot stand!

460
00:32:40,678 --> 00:32:44,378
Unfortunately, her power is already beyond my ability to stop.

461
00:32:44,678 --> 00:32:45,978
Please!

462
00:32:45,978 --> 00:32:48,978
You must do something to stop that demon!

463
00:32:49,178 --> 00:32:50,978
That monster...

464
00:32:50,978 --> 00:32:53,678
...she will surely only take more lives...

465
00:32:53,978 --> 00:32:57,678
...and plunge the world into further chaos!

466
00:32:57,978 --> 00:32:59,378
Come on! Quick!

467
00:32:59,978 --> 00:33:03,978
Ascend to the world of the living with your great scythe in hand...

468
00:33:03,978 --> 00:33:07,978
...and reap the life of the Demon of Sound before she can claim another victim!

469
00:33:09,178 --> 00:33:12,978
Avenge my life, and the life of my friend!

470
00:33:13,178 --> 00:33:14,178
I beg you!

471
00:33:14,178 --> 00:33:17,178
That demon cannot be left to ravage the world once more.

472
00:33:17,178 --> 00:33:19,978
I warned the other gods before, but here we are.

473
00:33:19,978 --> 00:33:22,178
It is time I take this into my own hands...

474
00:33:22,178 --> 00:33:25,178
...and do what I should have done long ago!

475
00:33:39,178 --> 00:33:42,378
Huh. Your demonic side was always to be the death of you, IRyS.

476
00:33:42,378 --> 00:33:44,978
Don't you dare speak her name!

477
00:33:45,178 --> 00:33:46,178
Silence!

478
00:33:46,678 --> 00:33:49,978
Your bloodlust and desire for adoration has clouded your judgment...

479
00:33:49,978 --> 00:33:53,178
...to the point where you can't even tell friend from foe anymore!

480
00:33:53,378 --> 00:33:57,178
You're the one who brought bloody doom upon your own beloved friend...

481
00:33:57,178 --> 00:33:58,978
...and yourself!

482
00:33:59,378 --> 00:34:04,978
Your fear of losing your hold over things brings about the very result you so fear!

483
00:34:05,178 --> 00:34:06,678
How dare you?!

484
00:34:06,678 --> 00:34:08,678
Continue on with your excuses.

485
00:34:08,678 --> 00:34:11,678
Blame who you will for your own wrongdoing if you wish.

486
00:34:11,978 --> 00:34:12,978
In the end...

487
00:34:12,978 --> 00:34:17,178
...you have only yourself to blame for the situation you find yourself in.

488
00:34:17,378 --> 00:34:21,678
A lust for love so strong that those you loved turn away.

489
00:34:22,178 --> 00:34:25,178
A desire for power so overwhelming...

490
00:34:25,378 --> 00:34:29,178
...those you have power over turn on you.

491
00:34:30,178 --> 00:34:36,178
An anger so deep that you destroy all who might have helped save you.

492
00:34:36,678 --> 00:34:39,678
Your fate has been sealed by your own hand.

493
00:34:40,178 --> 00:34:41,678
And now...

494
00:34:42,178 --> 00:34:45,978
...I am now here to deliver it to you.

495
00:34:46,678 --> 00:34:50,178
Why do you get to decide who lives or dies?

496
00:34:50,378 --> 00:34:54,178
You, who sits alone in your own realm...

497
00:34:54,378 --> 00:34:59,178
...empress of all, both life and death at your fingertips?

498
00:35:00,765 --> 00:35:02,565
Could you possibly know

499
00:35:02,565 --> 00:35:07,565
about the desire for the love and adoration of others?

500
00:35:07,565 --> 00:35:12,265
You, who already has everything...

501
00:35:12,765 --> 00:35:17,565
You and all the gods, all full of yourselves

502
00:35:17,565 --> 00:35:21,565
and so ready to look down upon those of us who fight for more.

503
00:35:21,765 --> 00:35:27,265
Mouths full of twisted tongues...

504
00:35:28,265 --> 00:35:32,765
Their hearts rot with jealousy.

505
00:35:33,965 --> 00:35:37,265
They're jealous...

506
00:35:37,265 --> 00:35:38,965
...of me!

507
00:35:40,765 --> 00:35:44,965
Spiteful that I was loved more!

508
00:35:50,565 --> 00:35:53,765
Again, you cannot see past your own desires.

509
00:35:53,965 --> 00:35:56,765
The gods took pity on you and your kind.

510
00:35:56,965 --> 00:35:59,765
When I created you, the first demon,

511
00:35:59,965 --> 00:36:06,265
the gods felt it unjust and dangerous for such a being to exist

512
00:36:06,265 --> 00:36:09,265
for the sole purpose of watching over the surface in my stead...

513
00:36:09,265 --> 00:36:11,265
...to be mindless...

514
00:36:11,265 --> 00:36:12,565
...soulless.

515
00:36:12,765 --> 00:36:14,565
So, they gave the demon a psyche

516
00:36:14,565 --> 00:36:18,565
and plucked it from my deepest and blackest halls,

517
00:36:18,765 --> 00:36:23,765
freeing it to roam amongst the two worlds whenever it pleased.

518
00:36:23,965 --> 00:36:28,765
I warned them that the demonic nature was too strong and dangerous to give such desires,

519
00:36:28,765 --> 00:36:32,265
and far too dangerous for such a being to exist alongside the mortals,

520
00:36:32,765 --> 00:36:35,765
but the others persisted. And now...

521
00:36:36,265 --> 00:36:43,765
...here we are, my unheeded warnings leading us back to where it all started.

522
00:36:44,265 --> 00:36:48,965
You almost plunged the world into chaos due to your unbridled lust for adoration.

523
00:36:49,265 --> 00:36:52,265
Time and time again, you gave in to your nature.

524
00:36:52,565 --> 00:36:56,765
Banishing you to a void was supposed to be a chance for you to reflect on your past,

525
00:36:56,965 --> 00:37:03,265
but it's only proven that you are truly unfit for this world.

526
00:37:14,265 --> 00:37:19,565
アイアイアイヘッチュー　なななななんですの
I-I-I hate you! W-W-W-What is this?

527
00:37:19,565 --> 00:37:21,265
キミがいなけりゃ　アタシはナイナイ
Without you, I'm nothing at all.

528
00:37:21,265 --> 00:37:23,265
アイアイソーデスネ　その通りです
Yes, yes, that's right! Exactly as you say!

529
00:37:23,265 --> 00:37:25,765
喉を過ぎれば　かいのありよう
Once it passes down my throat, it's worth taking.

530
00:37:36,265 --> 00:37:38,965
アイアイアイヘッチュー　なななななんですの
I-I-I hate you! W-W-W-What is this?

531
00:37:39,565 --> 00:37:41,965
キミは軽薄　くたびれだらく
You are shallow, exhausted, and self-indulgent.

532
00:37:41,965 --> 00:37:44,765
アタシ一言じゃいられない
I can't just stay quiet with one word.

533
00:37:44,765 --> 00:37:47,565
それはツネにつねにひしひし
That's always, always hitting me hard.

534
00:37:47,765 --> 00:37:50,565
アナタ WHY WHY DON'T YOU KNOW
You, why, why don't you know?

535
00:37:50,565 --> 00:37:52,565
だってダメダメですの
Because it's totally no-good!

536
00:37:52,565 --> 00:37:55,565
意味があるなら言葉にせずに
If it has meaning, without putting it into words,

537
00:37:55,565 --> 00:37:57,965
タダシイタイドデ示されなきゃ
unless you show it with proper attitude,

538
00:37:57,965 --> 00:38:00,565
すべてが伝わらないままになる TOP SECRET
everything will remain uncommunicated. Top secret!

539
00:38:00,565 --> 00:38:04,965
散落とさないように　騒げ！
So as not to scatter and lose it, make some noise!

540
00:38:04,965 --> 00:38:07,765
アイアイアイヘッチュー　なななななんですの
I-I-I hate you! W-W-W-What is this?

541
00:38:07,765 --> 00:38:09,565
キミがいなけりゃ　アタシはナイナイ
Without you, I'm nothing at all.

542
00:38:09,565 --> 00:38:11,565
アイアイソーデスネ　その通りです
Yes, yes, that's right! Exactly as you say!

543
00:38:11,565 --> 00:38:13,965
喉を過ぎれば　それは真実
Once it passes down my throat, it becomes the truth.

544
00:38:13,965 --> 00:38:18,265
ああるべき場所へ　アタシ導く
To where it ought to be, it guides me.

545
00:38:18,765 --> 00:38:23,565
奈落の底で　アイアイアイヘッチューなんですの
At the bottom of the abyss, I-I-I hate you! What is this?

546
00:38:35,265 --> 00:38:37,965
キミにアイアイアイヘッチュー　なななななんですの
I-I-I hate you! W-W-W-What is this?

547
00:38:38,265 --> 00:38:41,765
やはり軽薄　顔の大きなアタシ
As expected, shallow—me with my grand posture,

548
00:38:41,765 --> 00:38:44,565
渇いたソコヘ引きずのる
dragging it into that dry place.

549
00:38:44,565 --> 00:38:47,965
キミがいまかいまかと高嶺のソープ SECRET
You waiting impatiently for that high-altitude soap... secret!

550
00:38:47,965 --> 00:38:53,565
愛に滲んだ衝動が　喉をヤケドさせる GREAT SECRET
An impulse soaked in love burns my throat. Great secret!

551
00:38:53,765 --> 00:38:57,265
マニアウ？
Will I make it in time?

552
00:38:57,565 --> 00:38:58,965
出てこないで！
Don't come out!

553
00:38:58,965 --> 00:39:01,565
アイアイアイヘッチュー　なななななんですの
I-I-I hate you! W-W-W-What is this?

554
00:39:01,565 --> 00:39:04,265
キミがいるからアタシはタイタイ
Because you're here, I am equal.

555
00:39:04,265 --> 00:39:06,765
アイアイソーデスネ　その通りです
Yes, yes, that's right! Exactly as you say!

556
00:39:06,765 --> 00:39:09,765
欲望のまま保持したくの
I want to hold onto it just as my desires dictate.

557
00:39:43,265 --> 00:39:46,265
どうにもならない　アイアイアイヘッチュー
Nothing can be done about it! I-I-I hate you!

558
00:39:46,265 --> 00:39:48,265
なななななんですの
W-W-W-What is this?

559
00:39:48,265 --> 00:39:49,965
キミがいなけりゃ　アタシはナイナイ
Without you, I'm nothing at all.

560
00:39:49,965 --> 00:39:51,965
アイアイソーデスネ　その通りです
Yes, yes, that's right! Exactly as you say!

561
00:39:51,965 --> 00:39:55,265
喉を過ぎれば　それは真実
Once it passes down my throat, it becomes the truth.

562
00:39:55,765 --> 00:40:01,565
ああるべき場所へ　アタシ導く
To where it ought to be, it guides me.

563
00:40:02,646 --> 00:40:04,446
奈落の底で
At the bottom of the abyss...

564
00:40:36,246 --> 00:40:38,746
Oh, such a misguided fool.

565
00:40:39,246 --> 00:40:44,446
Your reckless ways have brought black doom upon yourself and those most beloved around you.

566
00:40:44,946 --> 00:40:50,646
Blaming your misery on others when your demise was, in fact, forged by your own hands.

567
00:40:51,246 --> 00:40:53,946
While you have earned your death in full,

568
00:40:54,446 --> 00:41:01,446
it is with pity, not anger, that this blade falls upon you.

569
00:41:29,946 --> 00:41:35,946
炉心融解
[Meltdown]

570
00:41:53,446 --> 00:41:59,246
街明かり華やか エーテルの麻酔の冷たさ
The bustling city and its neon lights, a touch of ether that's cold as ice

571
00:41:59,446 --> 00:42:04,646
眠れない午前二時 全てが急速に変わる
It's 2 AM and I can hardly sleep 'cause everything keeps changing rapidly

572
00:42:04,646 --> 00:42:07,746
オイル切れのライター
I'm like a lighter that's all out of gas

573
00:42:07,746 --> 00:42:10,646
焼けつくような胃の中
My insides are on fire

574
00:42:10,646 --> 00:42:13,446
全てがそう嘘なら
If only everything was a lie

575
00:42:13,446 --> 00:42:16,446
本当によかったのにね
Things would be so much better

576
00:42:16,446 --> 00:42:19,646
君の首を絞める夢を見た
I had a dream where these hands of mine were strangling your neck

577
00:42:19,646 --> 00:42:22,446
光の溢れる昼下がり
On a bright, sunny afternoon

578
00:42:22,446 --> 00:42:25,446
君の細い喉が跳ねるのを
I watched your slender throat twitch

579
00:42:25,446 --> 00:42:29,946
泣き出しそうな眼で見ていた
As my eyes welled up with tears

580
00:42:30,446 --> 00:42:38,946
核融合炉にさ 飛び込んでみたいと思う
I want to throw myself into a nuclear reactor

581
00:42:38,946 --> 00:42:42,246
真っ青な光包まれて綺麗
And its pale blue light would envelop me so beautifully

582
00:42:42,246 --> 00:42:49,446
核融合炉にさ 飛び込んでみたら
If I could throw myself into a nuclear reactor

583
00:42:49,446 --> 00:42:54,446
そしたらすべてが許されるような気がして
Then everything might be okay, I might be forgiven

584
00:43:05,446 --> 00:43:10,946
ベランダの向こう側 階段を昇っていく音
On the other side of the veranda, I hear footsteps ascending the stairs

585
00:43:10,946 --> 00:43:16,946
陰り出した空が 窓ガラスに部屋に落ちる
As the clouds creep over the sunlight, it drips through my window and into my room

586
00:43:16,946 --> 00:43:22,446
拡散する夕暮れ 泣き腫らしたような陽の赤
Twilight scatters across the horizon, red like eyes swollen by tears

587
00:43:22,446 --> 00:43:25,446
溶けるように少しずつ
Slowly but surely, it's melting away

588
00:43:25,446 --> 00:43:28,446
少しずつ死んでゆく世界
Slowly but steadily, the world is dying

589
00:43:28,446 --> 00:43:31,446
君の首を絞める夢を見た
I had a dream where these hands of mine were strangling your neck

590
00:43:31,446 --> 00:43:34,446
春風に揺れるカーテン
My curtains were swaying gently in the spring breeze

591
00:43:34,446 --> 00:43:37,446
乾いて切れた唇から
Your dry, parched lips mustered up

592
00:43:37,446 --> 00:43:41,946
こぼれる言葉は泡のよう
Words that would vanish like foam on the waves

593
00:43:42,446 --> 00:43:50,946
核融合炉にさ 飛び込んでみたいと思う
I want to throw myself into a nuclear reactor

594
00:43:50,946 --> 00:43:54,446
真っ白に記憶融かされて消える
Into the shining, white light my memories will fade and disappear

595
00:43:54,446 --> 00:44:01,446
核融合炉にさ 飛び込んでみたら
If I could throw myself into a nuclear reactor

596
00:44:01,446 --> 00:44:06,446
また昔みたいに眠れるような そんな気がして
I might be able to sleep like I used to and everything might be okay

597
00:44:28,946 --> 00:44:38,946
時計の秒針や テレビの司会者や
The second hand on the clock, and the host on the television

598
00:44:39,446 --> 00:44:44,446
そこにいるけど
There's someone there

599
00:44:44,946 --> 00:44:48,946
見えない誰かの
But I just can't see them

600
00:44:48,946 --> 00:44:52,446
笑い声 飽和して反響する
Their laughter swells and grows into an endless echo

601
00:44:52,446 --> 00:44:56,946
アレグロ・アジテート
Allegro agitate

602
00:44:56,946 --> 00:45:01,446
耳鳴りが消えない 止まらない
The ringing in my ears won't stop, it won't go away

603
00:45:04,439 --> 00:45:08,439
Allegro agitato

604
00:45:08,939 --> 00:45:15,239
耳鳴りが消えない 止まない
The ringing in my ears won't stop, it won't go away

605
00:45:41,439 --> 00:45:44,639
街の灯が消えてく夢を見た
I had a dream where the whole entire world disappeared

606
00:45:44,739 --> 00:45:46,939
真夜中の部屋の広さと
Tonight, I'm swallowed by the vastness of my dark room

607
00:45:47,039 --> 00:45:50,439
静寂が胸につっかえて
Yet, silence closes in and suffocates me

608
00:45:50,539 --> 00:45:54,539
上手く息ができなくなる
My lungs can't find the air I need to breathe

609
00:45:55,639 --> 00:46:02,439
核融合炉にさ 飛び込んでみたら
If I could throw myself into a nuclear reactor

610
00:46:02,539 --> 00:46:07,639
そしたらきっと眠るように消えていけるんだ
Then I could finally fade away, as easily as closing my eyes to sleep

611
00:46:07,739 --> 00:46:15,439
僕のいない朝は 今よりずっと素晴らしくて
A new dawn without me would surely be a dazzling new day

612
00:46:15,539 --> 00:46:18,939
全ての歯車が噛み合い
All of the gears would be turning together in harmony

613
00:46:19,039 --> 00:46:29,639
きっとそんな世界だ
Surely, that's how the world would be

614
00:47:03,539 --> 00:47:06,739
Hi, darlings! And welcome to my 3D concert,

615
00:47:06,739 --> 00:47:09,939
my first technically solo one.

616
00:47:10,139 --> 00:47:13,739
As you can see up here,

617
00:47:13,839 --> 00:47:16,639
is the hashtag for today,

618
00:47:16,639 --> 00:47:20,339
which is #RequiemforLove3D!

619
00:47:20,539 --> 00:47:22,639
I'm watching the chat. Did you guys enjoy it?

620
00:47:22,739 --> 00:47:24,839
Did you like it? Did you have fun?

621
00:47:24,939 --> 00:47:26,739
I sure hope so!

622
00:47:27,139 --> 00:47:31,439
Well, obviously a lot just happened,

623
00:47:31,439 --> 00:47:35,639
but I must let you all know this was all a musical.

624
00:47:35,639 --> 00:47:38,339
So none of it was real.

625
00:47:38,439 --> 00:47:40,339
No one is hurt.

626
00:47:40,339 --> 00:47:43,039
There were no hololive girls hurt in the making of this musical,

627
00:47:43,039 --> 00:47:45,239
so please don't worry!

628
00:47:45,539 --> 00:47:47,639
This stage is awesome,

629
00:47:47,639 --> 00:47:51,439
so I want to give it up to the team over at hololive production

630
00:47:51,439 --> 00:47:53,139
who put this all together.

631
00:47:53,139 --> 00:47:54,939
Can we just take a look,

632
00:47:54,939 --> 00:47:56,939
take a moment to admire this beautiful stage before us?

633
00:47:57,039 --> 00:47:59,839
Some of the more lesser-shown details

634
00:47:59,839 --> 00:48:02,139
I kind of wanted to highlight a little bit.

635
00:48:02,339 --> 00:48:04,539
So, let's go ahead and take a look at

636
00:48:04,539 --> 00:48:06,739
perhaps the moon, maybe?

637
00:48:06,839 --> 00:48:09,639
Look at that big thing in the background.

638
00:48:09,639 --> 00:48:11,839
It was also dark red at one point,

639
00:48:11,939 --> 00:48:14,939
but currently it is, as it probably should be,

640
00:48:14,939 --> 00:48:18,439
normal, beautiful, because I was killed, so...

641
00:48:18,539 --> 00:48:22,639
We also have the giant castle in the background,

642
00:48:22,639 --> 00:48:25,339
which is, oh my gosh, I was so excited for this.

643
00:48:25,339 --> 00:48:28,139
I was like, "Oh, I want something that's really kind of

644
00:48:28,139 --> 00:48:30,939
cathedral-esque and dark and gothic,"

645
00:48:30,939 --> 00:48:32,839
and they fully delivered.

646
00:48:32,839 --> 00:48:35,239
I'm so, so pleased with how it ended up looking in the final,

647
00:48:35,339 --> 00:48:36,639
so happy.

648
00:48:36,639 --> 00:48:39,339
We also have the beautiful stained glass.

649
00:48:39,439 --> 00:48:40,939
If you take a look,

650
00:48:40,939 --> 00:48:42,739
it's back there.

651
00:48:42,739 --> 00:48:44,739
These ones were actually screens,

652
00:48:44,739 --> 00:48:46,939
but we also have the ones on the side

653
00:48:46,939 --> 00:48:50,439
that were a little bit broken, but could also change as well.

654
00:48:50,539 --> 00:48:52,139
Very, very fun.

655
00:48:52,139 --> 00:48:55,239
It was kind of something that I was like, "Oh, I wonder how it's gonna go,"

656
00:48:55,239 --> 00:48:57,639
but I think it ended up looking really cool, right?

657
00:48:57,739 --> 00:49:01,739
Lastly, we have all of these lovely flowers

658
00:49:01,739 --> 00:49:03,739
out in front.

659
00:49:03,839 --> 00:49:05,839
I just thought they came out so pretty,

660
00:49:05,839 --> 00:49:09,839
and I like how they kind of change throughout.

661
00:49:09,839 --> 00:49:12,139
So it just kind of looked like nothingness,

662
00:49:12,139 --> 00:49:13,739
like a little void of like dead plants,

663
00:49:13,739 --> 00:49:16,239
but then at the end, they all bloomed and it was so beautiful!

664
00:49:16,639 --> 00:49:18,639
Oh my gosh, I was so nervous!

665
00:49:18,639 --> 00:49:21,239
And you might have noticed something's a little different about me today.

666
00:49:21,339 --> 00:49:26,039
Do you see anything different?

667
00:49:26,039 --> 00:49:28,139
My wings are out!

668
00:49:28,239 --> 00:49:32,439
I decided, since we've known each other for kind of a long time now,

669
00:49:32,439 --> 00:49:35,039
that maybe it was finally time to...

670
00:49:35,039 --> 00:49:37,139
